{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftagent\/multiagentcollaboration"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftAgent"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Multi-Agent Coordination & Protocols","role":"collectionGroup"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/MultiAgentCollaboration","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Complex analytical and reasoning workflows are frequently error-prone when performed by a single monolithic model. Decomposing problems into specialized roles—such as "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Planner"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analyst"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Critic"}]},{"type":"text","text":"—drastically improves reasoning accuracy, reduces hallucinations, and permits parallelized tool execution."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftAgent"},{"type":"text","text":" provides "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiAgentOrchestrator"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AgentMessageBus"},{"type":"text","text":", a reactive multi-agent framework built on Swift’s structured concurrency primitives ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncStream"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTaskGroup"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Architectural Topology","anchor":"Architectural-Topology"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["                         ┌───────────────────────┐","                     